## A. Track A — Interactive

- Cards: **2–3%** bg shift off canvas (`#0B0E14` → `#121620`). Soft shadows. No line dividers.
- Sections: whitespace only, no `<hr>`. Padding **96–128px** desktop.
- Stagger/offset grids; single column mobile.
- Atmospheric gradients at transitions — not hard cuts.
- Marketing/hero: **35–40%** blank canvas. Dashboards/tables: scannable density.
- Motion: **150–250ms** ease-out hover; **300–400ms** larger. One easing curve. `prefers-reduced-motion` fallback.
- States: hover, focus, active, disabled.
- **Focus rings mandatory** — exception to no hard borders. **44×44px** touch targets. No essential hover-only content.
- Breakpoints: `<640` / `640–1024` / `>1024`. Section padding **96–128 → 48–64** mobile. Fluid containers preserve 60ch.

## B. Track B — Static Visual

- Fixed canvas (slides **1920×1080**). Separate per social format.
- Safe zone **5–8%** inner margin.
- **One concept** per slide/graphic.
- Dark, glows, 2–3% elevation OK. Whitespace + focal point.
- Text on imagery needs scrim. Screen-share: size up, target AAA.
- Wall of text (>~50 words) → switch to Track C.

## C. Track C — Static Document

### C.1 Canvas & text
- Off-white canvas (e.g. `#F5F8FA`), not `#FFF`. Near-black text (`#354F5C` / `#1A1A1A`), not `#000`.
- 60–70ch measure; single column for long docs.

### C.2 Separation
- Hairline **~1px ~8% black** or subtle tint — not glow. Section gap **40–60px**. Thin rule under heading OK.

### C.3 Furniture
- Running headers/footers, page numbers on long docs. Fixed H1/H2/H3 spacing. Tables: 8px-multiple padding, light gridlines/zebra.

### C.4 Print / PDF
- Light bg; no full-bleed dark. Safe margin **≈0.5in / 12mm**. Embed fonts. Grayscale-legible. Reasonable file size.

### C.5 Email
- Table layout, **max 600px**. Cell padding separation. **Inline styles only** — no flex/grid/external sheets. Light bg for copy. Web-safe stacks.

